{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01242","headline":"相和歌辞 东门行 · 柳宗元","name":"相和歌辞 东门行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家三十六将军，东方雷动横阵云。\n鸡鸣函谷客如雾，貌同心异不可数。\n赤丸夜语飞电光，徼巡司隶眠如羊。\n当街一叱百吏走，冯敬胷中函匕首。\n凶徒侧耳潜惬心，悍臣破胆皆杜口。\n魏王卧内藏兵符，子西掩袂真无辜。\n羌胡毂下一朝起，敌国舟中非所拟。\n安陵谁辨削砺功，韩国讵明深井里。\n绝咽断骨那下补，万金宠赠不如土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}